*> EXEC CICS RETURN, XCTL, and ABEND end the unit like GOBACK: control
*> does not fall into the next paragraph.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CICSFLOW.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-LINE.
    IF EIBCALEN = 0
        PERFORM FIRST-TIME
    END-IF
    EXEC CICS XCTL PROGRAM('NEXTPGM') END-EXEC.
FIRST-TIME.
    EXEC CICS SEND TEXT FROM('WELCOME') END-EXEC
    EXEC CICS RETURN TRANSID('MENU') END-EXEC.
FAILURE.
    EXEC CICS ABEND ABCODE('PLB1') END-EXEC.
